# Welcome to Apache Maven

<div class="mh-hero">
  <p class="mh-lead">Apache Maven builds, tests and documents Java projects from a single project object model (POM).</p>
  <p class="mh-actions">
    <a class="mh-btn mh-btn-primary" href="download.html">Download Maven ${currentStableVersion}</a>
    <a class="mh-btn" href="guides/getting-started/maven-in-five-minutes.html">Maven in 5 minutes</a>
    <a class="mh-btn" href="what-is-maven.html">What is Maven?</a>
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mh-callout">
  <p><strong>Maven 4 (${current4xVersion})</strong> is on its way. Read <a href="whatsnewinmaven4.html">what's new</a>, <a href="guides/mini/guide-migration-to-mvn4.html">migrate a project</a>, or let the <a href="tools/mvnup.html">Maven Upgrade Tool</a> do the heavy lifting.</p>
</div>

