#[[##]]# How to Get Support

<div class="mh-grid mh-grid-compact">
  <div class="mh-card">
    <p class="mh-card-title">Search first</p>
    <p>The <a href="issue-management.html">issue tracker</a>, the <a href="mailing-lists.html">mailing list archives</a> and the <a href="https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/MAVEN">wiki</a> often already have the answer.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mh-card">
    <p class="mh-card-title"><a href="mailing-lists.html">Ask on users@</a></p>
    <p>The Maven Users mailing list is the main support channel, answered by users and developers alike and archived for the next person.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mh-card">
    <p class="mh-card-title"><a href="community.html">Chat on Slack</a></p>
    <p>Reach the Maven developers directly in the ASF Slack workspace.</p>
  </div>
</div>

